# promise: #616
# Tab sleeping ends a page's renderer, but its browser and hidden window stayed for the whole session.
# Forty background pages slept (cra://debug?sleepTabs, a one-second threshold), then the budget's pass:
# the slept pages hidden longest close, at most 8 a pass, and the window keeps 32.
budget rss=900 stalls50=100
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=first
wait 3
pace 0.3
repeat 40 cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=${i}
cra://action/nextTab
wait 4
cra://debug?sleepTabs=1
wait 6
expect-log tab sleep (unloads|discards)
cra://debug?closeSleptPages=1
expect-log slept pages: [1-8] closed beyond the 32 a window keeps
